discounts. Sometimes, I just<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-900347-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-900347-3' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-900347-3' /></span></strong> around the mall with my friends to look at beautiful clothes, shoes, and toys. For me, shopping is not just about buying - it&#8217;s also about exploring and having fun!</p>",
